[h1]Project Vigilance: Orbital Logistics & Satellites[/h1]
[b]Brings analytical Keplerian orbital constellations, drifting trade satellites, and persistent high-orbit logistics hubs to RimWorld 1.7.[/b]
Requires [i]Project Vigilance - Core Framework[/i]. Interconnects automatically with [i]Geoscape & Early Warning[/i] when active.
[hr][/hr]
[h2]Key Features[/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]Analytical Keplerian Flight Model:[/b] Simulates satellites along inclined orbital planes with J2 oblateness nodal precession, producing realistic drifting ground tracks across planetary longitudes.
[*] [b]Persistent Orbital Logistics Hubs:[/b] High-orbit faction stations anchor over populated coverage tiles with stratified LEO, MEO, and GEO visual altitude bands and faction-tinted custom sprites.
[*] [b]Live Orbital Trade Windows:[/b] Passing trade satellites open dynamic Comms Console trade links while overhead, delivering purchases via orbital drop pods with zero duplicate contact entries.
[*] [b]Dual-Layer Surface & Orbit Rendering:[/b] Cleanly separates orbital constellations from ground caravans and outposts when toggling Odyssey's Orbit view, while preserving space-layer telemetry on Odyssey stations and asteroids.
[*] [b]Fog-of-War & Visibility Integration:[/b] Automatically honours active visibility rules ([i]Fog of War[/i], [i]Planetary Surveillance[/i], [i]Omniscient[/i]) — non-player satellites remain hidden outside active sensor envelopes and deselect cleanly upon leaving coverage.
[*] [b]Zero-Lag Orbital Caching:[/b] Cached sensor snapshots and per-entity visibility lookups keep world-map frame rates smooth even with dense multi-faction constellations.
[/list]
[hr][/hr]
[h2]Compatibility & Load Order[/h2]
[olist]
[*] Harmony
[*] Core & Official DLCs (Odyssey fully supported, optional)
[*] Project Vigilance - Core Framework
[*] Project Vigilance - Geoscape & Early Warning (optional, recommended)
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Orbital Logistics & Satellites[/b]
[/olist]
[hr][/hr]
